Not a wise idea.  Cockatrices can become quite handy in the lowere
levels.  All you have to do is to grab some gloves for armor, and
then after you kill a cockatrice you can then pick it up without
any harm.  You can then wield it as a weapon, and any monster you
hit will turn to stone.  The cockatrice corpse willl eventually
disentegrate.  Any objects that a creature was carrying will also
be turned to stone as well.  Its handy against powerful monsters -
all it takes is one hit.

